strengths_and_weaknesses.value:
Strengths:
- Empirical validation of the model's effectiveness;
- A case study in real-world scenarios highlights the practical
   significance of the model.
Weaknesses:
-  Some formulas lack detailed explanations and analysis;
- Frequency-domain feature extraction may incur computational
   overhead, particularly for multivariate time series;
- Performance improvements are not significant across five real-world
datasets.

